        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Flay"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The Skinsaw seamer dealt damage with a melee weapon other than its war razor with their last action\n\nThe seamer makes a war razor Strike against the same creature that they just damaged. On a hit, the seamer slices a strip of flesh from the target and deals 1d6 persistent bleed damage in addition to the war razor's usual damage."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "one_action"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "3872a63f-3431-4fb5-b3e1-36c5826bd0f0",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:12:59.423553"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Quick Stitch"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The Skinsaw seamer is currently grappling a creature\n\nThe seamer stitches a piece of cloth to the creature's arm, face, or leg, potentially hindering it. The creature must attempt a 26 Reflex saving throw; if the seamer has already successfully used their Flay ability against the creature within the past minute, the creature's save result is one degree of success worse.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes 1d4 piercing damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature is clumsy 1, dazzled, enfeebled 1, or flat-footed (seamer's choice). This effect lasts until the creature spends a single action to tear out the stitching, which deals 1d6 piercing damage to it.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is clumsy 2, blinded, enfeebled 2, or flat-footed (seamer's choice). This effect lasts until the creature spends 2 actions to tear out the stitching, which deals 2d6 piercing damage to it."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "bf05188f-3967-4e28-9144-ffd189a58bec",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:12:59.423553"
            }
          }
        }
